{"parse": {"title": "成你本所是-07", "pageid": 139758, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%88%90%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%AC%E6%89%80%E6%98%AF-06\" title=\"成你本所是-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">成你本所是-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%88%90%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%AC%E6%89%80%E6%98%AF-08\" title=\"成你本所是-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">成你本所是</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.84.A6.E5.9C.9F.E4.B9.8B.E6.AD.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"焦土之歌\">焦土之歌</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 焦土之歌</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Scorching Wrath</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑暗开始稀薄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世界的一切都开始露出薄薄的轮廓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在这渐亮的、仿佛能暴露出一切秘密的日光下，焦黑的建筑残骸突兀地出现在了视线尽头。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>就……就是这里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风带来了熟悉的气味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不是果园的清香，而是更顽固的，已然渗入泥土与废墟石砾的，燃烧与悲伤混合的味道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>曾经的家园只剩下几段残垣，如同大地嶙峋的肋骨，刺向同样黯淡的天空。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>耳边仿佛又响起木材爆裂的噼啪、自己慌乱的哭喊，以及……尘酿鹰在火中的哀鸣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十六岁生日应有的悸动，被一种更冰冷的东西取代——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一种渗入骨肉的自责。它从未真正离开过她，此刻在焦土的气息中轰然苏醒，变本加厉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>如果我更勇敢一点……没有被吓坏……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>如果格林杜尔不需要救我，而是一直在爸爸身边……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一种因“不够”而导致的失落如同原罪般惩罚着她。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533706.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>离开，阿德琳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>稚嫩的声音在脑中响起，平静，却犹如尖叫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533706.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>用隐身术，现在就回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533706.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>回到果园，加固所有术阵。你不能再错一次了。等妈妈回来，她不会错。把问题交给不会错的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>充满诱惑的怯懦声音再次响起，替她为逃避披上了合理的外衣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>隐身术……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个念头如此诱人，逃避像一条黑暗但安全的退路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她甚至能感觉到体内那股源自母亲的、用于隐匿的神秘术能量正在轻轻涌动，渴望覆盖她的身形，抹去她此时此刻的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只需一道烂熟于心的咒文，她就能从这些贪婪的偷猎者眼前消失，将这棘手的难题交还给更强大可靠的女巫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533706.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>快啊，阿德琳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脚步慢了下来，几乎要停住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧握术杖的指尖微微发亮，就在神秘术即将释放的前一刻，她的目光掠过停在术杖上的雏鸟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"535603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-535603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-535603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"535603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-535603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-535603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-535603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-535603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小脑瓜：</div><div>咕！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小脑瓜圆亮的眼睛里，映出她此刻犹豫的脸，那里仿佛重叠着另一双眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一双直至最后都在焦土上凝望她的眼睛。那里有绝望，有决绝，却没有让步的余地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533706.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>在一切都无法挽回之前……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……我不要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她猛地攥紧了拳头，神秘术微光硬生生被掐灭在指尖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我知道，我可能会又一次把一切都搞砸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我不知道怎么做才是对的，但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>但将危险引向别处，将抉择的责任推给别人……我做不到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-533703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-533703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-533703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我很高兴，阿德琳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>声音消失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅱ：</div><div>怎么停下了，老实点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她深吸了一口气，将混合着灰烬与回忆的冰冷空气压入肺中，也压下了所有退缩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>就是这儿了，先生们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偷猎者们发出胜利将至的欢呼，携手钻入废墟查看“鸟巢”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就是现在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赤色火焰从手心射出，牢牢缠上其中一人执弓的手腕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅱ：</div><div>啊……啊啊啊啊啊啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>武器脱手，偷猎者中的一人抱着自己的手臂滚在了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳趁热打铁，第二发“火龙鳞鳞”蓄势待发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>该死，我就知道你有问题！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一名偷猎者反应极快，咒骂着从腰间拔出了武器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314619.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314619.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>火龙鳞鳞！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乡间生活的小女巫不了解这种造物的真正威力和使用方式，火焰撞上从黑洞口中射出的金属，在她身前极近之处爆发出剧烈跳动的火花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>唔……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她被巨大的声响和后坐力惊得后退了两步，失去平衡，狼狈地摔倒在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>你真是个麻烦的向导。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>好吧，看来我们没办法在这儿抓到大鸟了，但有你这两只小的也算不虚此行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在他狞笑着再次举起武器时，风毫无征兆地变了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314619.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314619.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>格林杜尔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一道肉眼几乎无法捕捉的灰影自空中俯冲而下，直指举枪的偷猎者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>撒网！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张泛着诡异光泽的大网精准地罩在了格林杜尔的必经之路上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“滋啦——！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵令人牙酸的侵蚀声响起。格林杜尔发出一声混合着痛苦与愤怒的尖锐长啸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"535003.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"535003.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格林杜尔：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它庞大的身躯再也无法维持与光影和谐共存的模糊状态，被彻底、清晰地暴露了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅱ：</div><div>成了！真的成了！是成年的尘酿鹰！活的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>这小鬼果然没骗我们……不，她骗了我们，但带来了更大的货！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偷猎者陷入狂喜中，但阿德琳没有动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她蹲了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十指深深陷入焦黑的土地，仿佛要握住这片沉默的土壤之下，那从未真正死去的脉络。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314621.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314621.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314621.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314621.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314621.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314621.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314621.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314621.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>多沃卡的防御术阵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神秘术能量化作最细微的触须，化作疏通淤塞的涓流，在这片伤痕累累的土地中穿行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314619.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314619.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……水，请归还这片土地被夺走的安宁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大地深处传来沉闷的咆哮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>什么声音？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偷猎者警惕地握紧了黑铁制成的武器，指向可疑的向导女巫，但他晚了一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>湛蓝的符文依次在死寂的土地上亮起。地下河以一种柔软而坚硬的可疑姿态冲破地面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅱ：</div><div>什、什……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>水……咕噜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似有生命的水龙缠上了敌人的头颅，它以最温柔的方式，残忍地夺走了敌人的空气。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偷猎者双双倒地的瞬间，少女炮弹似的奔向了被限制住行动的巨鸟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314623.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314623.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>格林杜尔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她趴在伏地的巨鸟身上，用一道道精密的神秘术切割着这张诡异的捕鸟网。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格林杜尔低下头，用巨大的喙极其轻柔地碰了碰她的额头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>格林杜尔？——阿德琳？！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "成你本所是-07"}}